OL,3,GNEWSAIslanders asked to report
OL,4,Asightings of rare eel
OL,5,
OL,6,FIslanders have been asked to record
OL,7,Fsightings of eels in a bid to help
OL,8,Fbuild a greater understanding of the
OL,9,Ffish.
OL,11,FGuernsey Nature Commission said there
OL,12,Fhad been a 95% decline in the European
OL,13,Feel population since the 1980s due
OL,14,Flargely to freshwater habitat loss and
OL,15,Fbarriers to inland feeding grounds.
OL,17,FThe International Union for
OL,18,FConservation of Nature's Red List of
OL,19,FThreatened Species has registered the
OL,20,FEuropean eel a critically endangered
OL,21,Fspecies, the category closest to
OL,22,Fextinction.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
